{"id":13900,"artist":"Gigi","title":"Thank Heaven For Little Girls.","lyrics_plain":"Now for example here we find,\nExhibit A: the married kind.\nThese ladies stood their ground and won,\nAnd I salute them ev'ry one.\nHere are some others to behold,\nfor whom the bells have never tolled.\nOh, what a poor defenceless pair,\nin those pathetic rags they wear.\nAnd here is the future.\nSomeday she will either be married or unmarried. Mademoiselle.\nEach time I see a little girl\nof five or six or seven,\nI can't resist a joyous urge to smile and say,\nThank Heaven for little girls!\nFor little girls get bigger eve'ry day.\nThank Heaven for little girls!\nThey grow up in the most delightful way.\nThose little eyes so helpless and appealing,\nOne day will flash,\nand send you crashing through the ceiling.\nThank Heaven for little girls!\nThank Heaven for them all,\nno matter where, no matter who.\nWithout them what would little boys do?\nThank Heaven....\nThank Heaven....\nThank Heaven for little girls!\nif this story is about a little girl.....\n...what you have to look forward to.\nThose little eyes\nso helpless and appealing,\nOne day will flash,\nand send you crashing through the ceiling.\nThank Heaven for little girls!\nThank Heaven for them all,\nno matter where, no matter who.\nWithout them what would little boys do?\nThank Heaven....\nThank Heaven....\nThank Heaven for little girls!","lyrics_synced":"[00:04.92] [Honore] Now for example here we find,\n[00:08.67] Exhibit A: the married kind.\n[00:12.42] These ladies stood their ground and won,\n[00:16.17] And I salute them ev'ry one.\n[00:27.42] Here are some others to behold,\n[00:31.17] for whom the bells have never tolled.\n[00:34.92] Oh, what a poor defenceless pair,\n[00:38.67] in those pathetic rags they wear.\n[00:41.41] [Honore speaks] And here is the future.\n[00:42.42] Someday she will either be married or unmarried. Mademoiselle.\n[00:57.67] [Honore sings] Each time I see a little girl\n[01:00.43] of five